1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your car feels sluggish, and you're
filling up more than you used to.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Acceleration feels weak. Idle's a little
rough. Maybe a whiff of gas at startup.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: a clogged engine air filter.
It can choke off the air your engine needs.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Less air means a richer fuel mix —
less power, worse mileage.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
It's a 30-second check. Pull the filter,
hold it to the light — if you can't
see through it, it's time.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before it costs you more
at the pump. Stop by and we'll take a
look. Nick's Tire & Auto.
